<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kodak cut by Prudential.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kodak cut by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Alex Henderson said he downgraded Eastman Kodak Co from hold to buy.</p>
<p>-- cut his 1997 earnings per share estimate on Kodak to $4.40 from $4.85.</p>
<p>-- cut his 1998 estimate to $4.75 from $5.65.</p>
<p>-- cited Kodak's lower-than-expected second quarter earnings, which he said was an indication the company was losing market share.</p>
</text>
